Solo - Fast and Passionate)\n不经受磨砺 怎能见锋芒\n不经历黑暗 怎知光的力量\n去奔跑吧 像从未受伤一样！\n\n[Chorus]\n阳光总在风雨后\n请相信有彩虹 在尽头守候\n所有的泪水 都会化作星斗\n照亮你 曾经孤独的奋斗\n阳光总在风雨后\n逆风的翅膀 才更有力挥动\n跨越了巅峰 握紧你的梦\n世界在为你 尽情地嘶吼\n\n[Outro]\n(Drum roll)\n阳光总在风雨后\n就在风雨后...\n(Final power chord)\n(Fade out)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [21], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-547.8757934570312, 690.5660400390625], "widgets_values": ["Pop Rock, Uplifting, Energetic, Electric Guitar Riffs, Driving Drums, Powerful Male Vocals, Inspiring, 120 BPM, Anthemic"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 16, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "文本", "links": [22], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "size": [378.764404296875, 271.428466796875], "pos": [791.4329223632812, 195.1701202392578], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 9, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 12, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "文本", "links": [23], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "size": [378.764404296875, 271.428466796875], "pos": [785.7073974609375, 532.3634643554688], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 8, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"